SUMMARY:Cocktail Classes at Durham Distillery | American Classics\, July 14 6:30PM
DESCRIPTION:Milk Punch\nClarified\, silky\, and unexpectedly bright\, Milk Punch is where science meets elegance. This class covers the technique of milk clarification and explores the roles of acidity\, texture\, and balance in creating crystal clear\, velvety cocktails.
