SUMMARY:Durham Chess Club - Weekly Meetup
DESCRIPTION:A free\, welcoming space for everyone to play and enjoy chess. Beginners and children highly encouraged to come. We host a relaxed\, non-competitive atmosphere. We invite you to stop by. \nWeekly Meetups – Meeting Location and Time\nWe now meet every Wednesday 5:45 PM–8:30 PM at 530 Foster St\, Suite 1\, Durham\, NC 27701 (Durham Food Hall). It is free\, and all are welcome.
