UID:10233199-1784167200-1784512799@downtowndurham.com
SUMMARY:Oyster Fest at The Durham
DESCRIPTION:Oyster Fest returns July 16–19 | The Roof\nShuck and slurp your way through Oyster Fest 2026: The Durham’s fifth annual summer celebration of North Carolina oysters\, summer flavors\, and live music. Join us on The Roof Thursday\, July 16 through Sunday\, July 19 for four nights of oysters\, live music\, and a shooter bar running Friday and Saturday. \nCome hungry and ready to enjoy raw and broiled oysters with summery sides. Cousins Oyster Co. will be on site Friday and Saturday\, shucking for the shooter bar and the OBX Oyster Flight Experience. Kill Devil Rums from Outer Banks Distilling and Durham Distillery will be on The Roof all weekend with tastings and featured spirits. The NC Shellfish Growers Association joins us all four days\, sharing about their work advocating for shellfish farmers\, advancing research\, and promoting responsible aquaculture in North Carolina. Every guest who donates to support their work is entered to win a night at The Durham and a farm tour with the NCSGA. \nAll food and drink are à la carte. Reservations are suggested for Thursday’s Al Strong kickoff; no reservations required the rest of the weekend. \nWant the full experience? Book your room at The Durham and take the elevator home. Book your stay →
URL:https://downtowndurham.com/event/oyster-fest-at-the-durham/
LOCATION:The Durham Hotel\, 315 E Chapel Hill Street\, Durham\, NC\, 27701\, United States
CATEGORIES:Food & Drink
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://downtowndurham.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/OysterFest.jpg
GEO:35.9971857;-78.900891
