SUMMARY:TODD LEVINS: FAIL\, REPEAT  - Third Friday Opening Reception
DESCRIPTION:5 Points Gallery is proud to present Fail\, Repeat\, a new exhibition by Featured Artist Todd Levins. Celebrating the creative process of experimentation\, refinement\, and persistence\, Levins’ finely crafted furniture and sculptural woodwork reveal the natural beauty and character of wood through clean lines\, thoughtful construction\, and refined craftsmanship. Working with carefully selected hardwoods\, he creates contemporary pieces that balance functionality with artistry\, inviting both everyday use and lasting appreciation. Join us for the Opening Reception on July 17\, 2026\, from 6–9 pm to meet the artist and experience this exceptional body of work. Enjoy the varied creations of our ten Triangle-based artists working in painting\, sculpture\, fused glass\, and mixed media. The exhibition runs from July 16 through August 15\, 2026. Image: Utopia Dining Table\, solid white oak with steel fasteners\, finished in satin polyacrylic\, 32 × 69 × 30 inches\, 2-inch-thick top. \nVisit 5 Points Gallery in person or online at https://5pointsgallery.com. All work from the exhibition is available for shipping or pickup. Gallery hours: Thursdays and Fridays 5–9pm\, Saturdays 1–9pm. Artists are available to talk about their work. For a private viewing\, contact us at info@5pointsgallery.com.
URL:https://downtowndurham.com/event/todd-levins-fail-repeat-third-friday-opening-reception/
LOCATION:5 Points Gallery\, 109 E Chapel Hill St\, Durham\, NC\, 27701\, United States
CATEGORIES:Art,Date Night,Exhibit,Free,Third Friday
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://downtowndurham.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Todd-Levins-Fail-Repeat-5-Points-Gallery-Featured-Artist-4.jpg
