SUMMARY:Third Friday at The Fruit
DESCRIPTION:Make The Fruit a destination on your 3rd Friday downtown gallery circuit this month. We’re happy to share that we’ll be hosting our next gallery pop-up on Friday\, July 17th. \nOver the past 9 years\, The Fruit has been a gathering space for underground and emerging artists to showcase work that inspires\, challenges\, sparks connections\, and drives conversation. We’re proud to continue this legacy. \nA great chance to mix with artists\, enthusiasts\, and collectors from the Durham arts scene and beyond\, join us between 6pm-10pm to check out our latest contemporary fine art installations and meet the local artists behind them \nFree entry\, friendly faces\, cold drinks. Mark your calendars!
URL:https://downtowndurham.com/event/third-friday-at-the-fruit/
