SUMMARY:Fever Dream: Party @ Future Hooman Art Exhibit
DESCRIPTION:Our Flux & Drift party series at Future Hooman is back in July during the Downtown Durham 3rd Friday Art Walk for… \n🔥 FEVER DREAM 🔥 \n– Enjoy Hot Summer Sounds\n– Wander our Trippy Exhibit Space\n– Party with Curious Beautiful Weirdos\n– Snack on Light Nibbles & Drinks\n– Jump into Playful Participatory Nonsense (optional) \nCome ready to have fun\, connect with other creative folks\, and heat up the night – as yourself\, or as someone else. At the end of the night you’ll be asking “was it all a dream?” \nAs usual costumes & character role play is encouraged! And… as always\, the exhibit will be open with new goodies we’ve added in the last month. \nParty starts at 7pm and runs til we get tired and go home. Feel free to drop by anytime before 10pm.
URL:https://downtowndurham.com/event/fever-dream-party-future-hooman-art-exhibit/
LOCATION:Future Hooman\, 109 W Orange St\, Durham\, 27701
CATEGORIES:Mixers and Parties
